        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n        The subject segment begins at the target: a leg of an itinerary at the\n        station it leaves, a river reach at its upstream confluence. With\n        plato:EndsAt it gives a segment a direction. A segment with no\n        direction is joined to its two ends with plato:HasEnd.\n    "
