  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/plato#MergedInto",
    "@type": [
      "https://w3id.org/plato#RelationType",
      "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n        The subject ceased, with at least one other entity, to form the\n        target, a new entity, from the attested date: two municipalities\n        merged into a third that took neither's identity. One attestation\n        for each party, all with the same target and date. If the target is\n        one of the parties carrying on under its old identity, it is an\n        absorption (plato:AbsorbedBy) whatever word the source uses, and\n        that word belongs in plato:source_label.\n    "
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/plato"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/plato#SucceededBy"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The subject ceased, with at least one other entity, to form the target, a new entity, from the attested date: two municipalities merged into a third that took neither's identity. One attestation for each party, all with the same target and date. If the target is one of the parties carrying on under its old identity, it is an absorption (plato:AbsorbedBy) whatever word the source uses, and that word belongs in plato:source_label."
      }
    ],
